        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "Here, the books you asked me for last time."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "I had to spend an age searching in those Londinium libraries, not even knowing Victorian. Grabbed some poor Feline in the end to find your stuff."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "Sometimes I see you writing and drawing in this blank book too."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "You don't just read, you write your own stuff too?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "I've never been to Kazdel, but I hear they've got a whole Sarkaz university underground there."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "Are you a teacher there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_393_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "No, I'm just like you. Putting my life up for sale."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "Are these books really that fun to read?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_393_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "They all end fine enough, but similar events keep happening over and over."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_393_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "All the authors can do is keep writing fine enough endings."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_393_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "And I've gotten sick of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "General Manfred made us lock you in here, but hasn't given any further orders since..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "How did you offend him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_393_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Maybe, he just thought jail would be more peaceful for me."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_393_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "It's easier in here... to do whatever I'd actually like to do."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "And that's reading?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "You really are a boring guy, then."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "I hear... us Sarkaz are going to get some real good news, real soon."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "So good it'll stun the entire land!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_393_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "It's just going to be another war."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "Has anyone ever told you you're a drag to talk to?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_393_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Honestly, yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "Seriously... what a drag."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "Alright, I'm changing shifts. You behave in here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "Don't forget, you promised to pay me for the books\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Royal Court soldier's silhouette disappears with a wobble into the end of the prison corridor, and very soon, a different set of footsteps comes into earshot."
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoederer waits."
    },
    {
        "text": "But there is only quiet."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
