        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Royal Court Soldier",
        "text": "The crew are all aboard the airship now."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Paprika."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "Urk... Here!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Have you ever read a book called... <i>A History of Sarkaz War?</i>"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "No."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "You should. I have a copy in my drawer. You can take it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "Is it a very fancy story?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "It is a history annals."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#14$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "You said that already..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Then you shouldn't be asking that sort of question."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "I disapprove of near to every viewpoint expressed in it. The weakness, the grief, the crushing."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "But still, I recognize that it is a book whose pages are soaked in blood."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "How would the writer describe the war we're seeing right now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "I'm as curious as you."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
